#: ../../source/pinkie_readme.md:12
msgid ""
"There are [tons of Promise implementations](https://github.com/promises-"
"aplus/promises-spec/blob/master/implementations.md#standalone) out there,"
" but all of them focus on browser compatibility and are often bloated "
"with functionality."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/pinkie_readme.md:14
msgid ""
"This module is an exact Promise specification polyfill (like [native-"
"promise-only](https://github.com/getify/native-promise-only)), but in "
"Node.js land (it should be browserify-able though)."
msgstr ""

